From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Badal Nilawar <badal.nilawar@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:07:04 +0530
Subject: [Temp] drm/xe/xe_late_bind_fw: Enable late binding support for CRI

Enable late binding support for CRI

Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:GPT-5.3
Cc: Daniele Ceraolo Spurio <daniele.ceraolospurio@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Badal Nilawar <badal.nilawar@intel.com>
(backported from https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/series/162657/#rev4)
Signed-off-by: Rachapalli Bandi Jagadeesh <jagadeesh.rachapalli.bandi@intel.com>

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
index bc4517e79..bbb743c6c 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
@@ -482,6 +482,8 @@ static const struct xe_device_desc cri_desc = {
 	.has_soc_remapper_telem = true,
 	.has_sriov = true,
 	.has_sysctrl = true,
+	.late_bind_mask = BIT(XE_LB_FW_FAN_CONTROL) |
+			  BIT(XE_LB_FW_OCODE),
 	.max_gt_per_tile = 2,
 	MULTI_LRC_MASK,
 	.va_bits = 57,
